  "Five compositions were rejected in every one of the nine themes, so those are composition verdicts and not theme verdicts: Corner, Inset Panel, Oversize, Quiet Pair, Sequence.",
  "Ground treatment is the strongest cross-cutting signal in the pass. Flooding the card with brand scored 5/27 (19%) across three independent compositions, against 51% on paper, 56% on a tint and 8/9 on a half-and-half split. The three worst non-zero compositions are exactly the three flooded ones.",
